2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2369) 'Shadows
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2369  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2369) 'Avatars and characters cast their shadows from tapered capsules fitted per skeleton (issue 110), not from the shadow map. An untapered capsule keeps stock Godot's height and radius behaviour.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2369  1 LINE
 Text:Written

